'''Ghosts''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 5th tier in the Battle Pass during the [[Halloween Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
This knife uses the default knife mesh, but instead has three ghosts with different facial expressions imprinted on it, hence the name, and a silver guard.



